{
  "life": [
    {
      "id": "life-01",
      "theme": "life",
      "text": "别急，时机正在成熟。",
      "tone": "gentle"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-02",
      "theme": "life",
      "text": "答案已经在路上。",
      "tone": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-03",
      "theme": "life",
      "text": "这次，听从自己的感受。",
      "tone": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-04",
      "theme": "life",
      "text": "先迈出一小步。",
      "tone": "caution"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-05",
      "theme": "life",
      "text": "不必急着证明什么。",
      "tone": "humor"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-06",
      "theme": "life",
      "text": "你需要的不是答案，而是勇气。",
      "tone": "gentle"
    },
    {
      "id": "life-07",
      "theme": "life",
      "text": "允许事情慢慢发生。",
